    "sections": {
        "description": "Yoga Fitness Studio is designed for yoga studio websites, yoga instructors, fitness studios, wellness centers, personal trainers, and meditation classes that need a clean and structured online presence, making it ideal for the fitness industry. It provides organized sections for presenting yoga classes, fitness programs, class schedules, instructor profiles, wellness services, events, and blog content in a clear and engaging way. The theme supports responsive design, ensuring smooth performance across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It works seamlessly with the block editor, allowing flexible page creation using core blocks and customizable layouts. Pre-designed pages such as About, Contact, Services, and Blog help manage content efficiently. The theme focuses on class presentation, yoga session details, online booking information, and appointment scheduling. It supports essential features like contact and appointment forms compatible with the Contact Form 7 plugin for easy inquiries and bookings, and also integrates smoothly with WooCommerce to create shop pages and product pages for selling yoga accessories, fitness products, and wellness items. With an SEO-friendly structure and clean design, Yoga Fitness Studio helps improve visibility for searches like yoga classes near me, fitness studio, and wellness center while offering a professional platform for growing a yoga or fitness business online."
    },
